    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Now that we have a `map` branch, let's move to it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "`git switch map` moves your HEAD to the map branch."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "And `git switch -c <name>` makes a new branch and moves to it in one go."
    }
  ],
